" whothis managed .ideavimrc
"
" Single source of truth: mirror the regular vim config. IdeaVim applies the
" settings it supports (numbers, search, indentation, scrolloff, ...) and
" ignores the rest (wildmenu, listchars, undofile, colorcolumn, ...). Edit the
" real config at ~/.vim/vimrc, not here.
source ~/.vim/vimrc
